{
  "slug": "hissatech-website",
  "projectSlug": "hissatech",
  "title": "Website",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "k75dglrb",
      "title": "The problem",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "axjnnguc",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "kgrpwflp",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "The site has to earn a download before the product can earn a customer"
              },
              {
                "id": "y0j1h0ks",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "Real estate in Saudi Arabia is understood physically. You see the building, you hold the deed, you know the street. Fractional ownership breaks all three: you buy 1% of a property you will never visit, and what you own is a certificate rather than a door."
              },
              {
                "id": "4irxutvp",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "That is the site's whole problem. Someone arriving here has not committed anything yet, and the thing being asked of them is not small: install a financial app and put money into an instrument they have never heard of. Every section had to close part of that gap, or it did not belong on the page."
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "problem"
    },
    {
      "id": "j08iqbm8",
      "title": "What was there before",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "u0zsnzam",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "vn9lm9ym",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "The old site asserted trust. It did not show it."
              },
              {
                "id": "v087r8e5",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "The previous site listed opportunities and stated that the company was licensed. There was no calculator, no explanation of how a share is created, no Sharia ruling, no partners, no founders. Sixteen FAQ entries sat on the landing page in place of an argument."
              },
              {
                "id": "r0wjhf0a",
                "kind": "table",
                "head": [
                  "",
                  "Before",
                  "After"
                ],
                "rows": [
                  [
                    "Return calculator",
                    "None",
                    "On the landing page"
                  ],
                  [
                    "How a share is created",
                    "Not explained",
                    "A page of its own"
                  ],
                  [
                    "Sharia ruling",
                    "Not shown",
                    "Named scholar, certificate linked"
                  ],
                  [
                    "Partners",
                    "None",
                    "Five, named"
                  ],
                  [
                    "Founders",
                    "None",
                    "Four, with photographs"
                  ],
                  [
                    "FAQ on landing",
                    "16 entries",
                    "4, with a link"
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
